		"unknown object": `{"manifest":{"repo_key":"r","brain_schema_version":"1.0","generated_at":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"},` +
			`"future":{"k":1,"k":2}}`,
		"object inside array": `{"manifest":{"repo_key":"r","brain_schema_version":"1.0","generated_at":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"},` +
