		"live C++ public-header scenario: recall@8 0->1, reciprocal-rank 0->0.5; compact_v3 bytes %d->%d (%+d), ceil(bytes/4) proxy %d->%d (%+d)",
		len(baselinePacket), len(candidatePacket), byteDelta,
